1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/ai-agent/ai-agent-react-vs-workflow","children":["ReAct 是更好的故事，Workflow 是更好的系统"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/ai-agent-react-vs-workflow.jpg","alt":"ReAct 是更好的故事，Workflow 是更好的系统 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"AI Agent"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"ReAct 是更好的故事，Workflow 是更好的系统"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"从一次电商 AI Agent 实践出发，聊聊 ReAct Agent、Workflow Agent，以及为什么业务生产系统最终还是要回到确定性。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2026-06-15T21:58:37.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2026/06/15"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","5,463"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["最近一直在公司做一款电商方向的 AI Agent，大概是辅助购物类的 Agent，更具体的就不方便说了（虽然我也不知道有没有关系）。项目当然也还没成功，还未全面上线，不过在这个过程中，笔者也算积累了不少的经验（",["$","del","del-0",{"children":"折磨"}],"），尤其是在 ReAct 和 Workflow 这两种架构模式上，有了一些个人的理解，所以就准备写篇文章来唠唠。"]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"自从有了 AI 后，手写文章的次数和频率真是越来越少了。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本篇不是严格意义上的技术分享，也不是某个框架的最佳实践教程。笔者更想聊的是一个很现实的问题：为什么大家都喜欢做 ReAct Agent？为什么它在 Demo、PPT、社交媒体里面那么有吸引力？以及，为什么真正到了高频、低容错、强业务目标的生产场景里，笔者反而越来越觉得，Workflow 才是更现实的底座。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"这里可以先给出笔者的个人观点："}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"garden-callout-marker garden-callout-marker--info","aria-hidden":"true"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"一句话核心"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"ReAct 是更好的故事，Workflow 是更好的系统。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"当然，这句话不是说 ReAct 没有价值，也不是说 Workflow 能解决一切问题。更准确一点说，ReAct 适合处理那些路径未知、需要动态探索的问题；Workflow 适合承接那些目标明确、流程稳定、需要强兜底的业务系统。真正靠谱的生产架构，通常也不是二选一，而是让 Workflow 控制主流程，让 ReAct 只进入那些局部不确定、但又可以被验证和兜底的小闭环里。"}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"什么是-react什么是-workflow","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#什么是-react什么是-workflow","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#什么是-react什么是-workflow"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"什么是 ReAct、什么是 Workflow","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":5,"offset":709},"end":{"line":19,"column":27,"offset":731}}}]},"children":"什么是 ReAct、什么是 Workflow"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"先讲 Workflow。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"Workflow 看名字就知道，它代表的是一个需要被前置定义好的工作流程。系统按照一个相对明确的执行图往下跑。它适合那些流程比较固定的场景，优点就是确定性高、稳定性强、好调试、好兜底，缺点也很明显：通用性较差，不太适合那种一开始就不知道要怎么做的开放性任务。"}],"\n",["$","$L8","pre-0,code-0",{"source":"flowchart LR\n    I[Input]\n    subgraph Workflow\n        C1[Step or node 1]\n        G{Gate or route}\n        C2[Step or node 2]\n        C3[Step or node 3]\n        J[Join or evaluator]\n        O[Output]\n        I --> C1 --> G\n        G --> C2 --> J\n        G --> C3 --> J\n        J --> O\n    end"}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":["ReAct 则不一样。ReAct 来自 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Reasoning and Acting"}],"。在工程实现中，它通常被展开为 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Thought/Reasoning → Action → Observation"}]," 的循环：模型先基于上下文生成下一步判断，再调用工具或执行动作，然后把外部观察结果重新放回上下文，继续下一轮决策。"]}],"\n",["$","$L8","pre-1,code-0",{"source":"flowchart LR\n    U[User task]\n    subgraph ReAct\n        P[Prompt and tool schemas]\n        T[Model reasoning]\n        A{Tool action?}\n        O[Tool result or environment observation]\n        F[Final answer]\n        P --> T --> A\n        A -->|yes| O --> T\n        A -->|no| F\n    end\n    U --> P"}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a"]}]}],"$L5b","$L5c","$L5d"]}],"$L5e"]}]]}]}]
